        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_977216a210934faa92eaa6897f799d6e",
      "statement": "Agent prompts are pre-digested in Python before the agent wakes: digest_reviewer_git_context pre-computes the git log, diffstat, and a bounded diff (max 100 lines / 4000 chars) so the reviewer avoids exploratory git tool calls.",
