      "statement": "board_memories is the per-board repository-knowledge substrate (category, content, tags, author) that the dispatcher pre-digests into every spawned worker's prompt so agents avoid repeating past mistakes; it is the SQLite half of a dual-write pair with Mem0 vector storage.",
