    {
      "id": "claim_52afeeb2adc94efdb2be253c7acbd2f3",
      "statement": "A deterministic precommit pipeline (.zerofactory/precommit.sh: format → build → test) is enforced by the dispatcher between a worker's output and a real PR, so a broken build or lint error never reaches a human.",
