    {
      "id": "claim_c7955bedd4d14e859f045d1c4a40fc66",
      "statement": "'done' is strictly terminal: when an agent actor (builder/reviewer) reports completion the task stays 'running' with metadata awaiting_pr=true (the packaging phase) and the dispatcher runs precommit → commit → push → PR → route to reviewer via _package_and_open_pr; only a terminal event (human close, merged PR, auto-merge, or close_pr archive) finalizes it via _finalize_terminal_done, which never commits, pushes, or re-opens review.",
